              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.1+MAT.12.2+MAT.12.3+MAT.12.4+MAT.12.5+MAT.12.6+MAT.12.7+MAT.12.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 12:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Obundi akaba naaraba omu misiri y'oburo aha izooba rya Sabato; abeegi be baagyenda nibacwa obushiisha bw'oburo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafarisaayo baamubuuza bati: Reeba, ahabw'enki abeegi baawe nibakora ekirikuzira, okucwa obushiisha aha izooba rya Sabato? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagarukamu ati: Beitu shi, timukashomaga eki Daudi yaakozire, obu yaabaire ashobeirwe, aine enjara, we n'abu yaabiare aine? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.21.1+1SA.21.2+1SA.21.3+1SA.21.4+1SA.21.5+1SA.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 21:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu biro ebi Abiasaari yaabaire ari omunyamurwa omukuru, Daudi akataaha omu nju ya Ruhanga, yaarya aha migaati ey'okumurikwa, yaagaruka yaahaho n'abu yaabaire aine, eki Ebiragiro byabaire bizibira omuntu weena kukora, kureka abanyamurwa bonka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagambira ati: Sabato ekateebwaho ahabw'abantu; kwonka ti bantu ahabwa Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo Omwana w'omuntu niwe Mukama wa Sabato nayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.2.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
